# LUMEN — THE AI WORKFLOW PLAYBOOK

## Build a Premium Glassmorphic AI Landing Page

Build a highly polished, conversion-focused, animated landing page for **LUMEN**, a fictional AI productivity and workflow automation company.

LUMEN is a provisional brand name and should be easy to replace.

The landing page promotes a free downloadable resource:

**The AI Workflow Playbook**

Tagline:

"Make repetitive work a thing of the past."

The objective is to convince visitors to submit their work email to access a practical PDF about designing AI-powered workflows.

This must be a standalone lead-generation landing page, not a conventional multi-page SaaS website.

The design should feel like a premium creative-technology studio experience: light glassmorphism, layered translucent interfaces, pastel refractions, elegant typography, and responsive 2.5D interaction.

The strongest visual feature is an **interactive floating glass AI workspace** that explains how information moves through an automation system.

Build a real interactive experience, not a static mockup.

